# text = This was the page at which the favourite volume always opened Precisely such had the paragraph originally stood from the printer's hands ; but Sir Walter had improved it by adding , for the information of himself and his family , these words , after the date of Mary's birth and by inserting most accurately the day of the month on which he had lost his wife .
