# text = He had given her some hints of it the last spring in town ; he had gone so far even as to say and Elizabeth , to do her justice , had , in the first ardour of female alarm , set seriously to think what could be done , and had finally proposed these two branches of economy , to cut off some unnecessary charities , and to refrain from new furnishing the drawing-room ; to which expedients she afterwards added the happy thought of their taking no present down to Anne , as had been the usual yearly custom .
