# text = The girls looked all amazement he continued cried the Admiral replied Captain Wentworth , seriously cried Louisa said he , smiling Anne's shudderings were to herself alone ; but the Miss Musgroves could be as open as they were sincere , in their exclamations of pity and horror said Mrs Musgrove , in a low voice , as if thinking aloud beckoning him to her Charles , being somewhat more mindful of the probabilities of the case , only nodded in reply , and walked away .
