# text = The surprise of finding himself almost alone with Anne Elliot , deprived his manners of their usual composure : he started , and could only say before he walked to the window to recollect himself , and feel how he ought to behave had been Anne's reply , in all the confusion that was natural ; and if the child had not called her to come and do something for him , she would have been out of the room the next moment , and released Captain Wentworth as well as herself .
