# text = The party from Uppercross passing down by the now deserted and melancholy looking rooms , and still descending , soon found themselves on the sea-shore ; and lingering only , as all must linger and gaze on a first return to the sea , who ever deserved to look on it at all , proceeded towards the Cobb , equally their object in itself and on Captain Wentworth's account : for in a small house , near the foot of an old pier of unknown date , were the Harvilles settled .
