# text = After talking , however , of the weather , and Bath , and the concert , their conversation began to flag , and so little was said at last , that she was expecting him to go every moment , but he did not ; he seemed in no hurry to leave her ; and presently with renewed spirit , with a little smile , a little glow , he said She assured him that she had not said he and he passed his hand across his eyes , as if the remembrance were still too painful , but in a moment , half smiling again , added said he , looking not exactly forward He stopped .
