# text = She had previously , in the anticipation of their marriage , been very apprehensive of losing her friend by it ; but on being assured that he could have made no attempt of that nature , since he did not even know her to be in Bath , it immediately occurred , that something might be done in her favour by the influence of the woman he loved , and she had been hastily preparing to interest Anne's feelings , as far as the observances due to Mr Elliot's character would allow , when Anne's refutation of the supposed engagement changed the face of everything ; and while it took from her the new-formed hope of succeeding in the object of her first anxiety , left her at least the comfort of telling the whole story her own way .
