# text = After listening to this full description of Mr Elliot , Anne could not but express some surprise at Mrs Smith's having spoken of him so favourably in the beginning of their conversation was Mrs Smith's reply Anne could just acknowledge within herself such a possibility of having been induced to marry him , as made her shudder at the idea of the misery which must have followed .
