# text = After waiting a few moments he said , and as if it were the result of immediate feeling Whether he would have proceeded farther was left to Anne's imagination to ponder over in a calmer hour ; for while still hearing the sounds he had uttered , she was startled to other subjects by Henrietta , eager to make use of the present leisure for getting out , and calling on her companions to lose no time , lest somebody else should come in .
